        <div class="container col-lg-9 col-sm-12 body-container color-overlay">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-12">
                    <div class="general-content">
                                                    <div class="body"><p>We have developed a <a href="https://www.asc.ca/en/issuer-regulation/issuer-and-insider-toolkit#series">series of introductory videos</a> to be educational and help reduce the regulatory burden on Alberta-based issuers.&nbsp;</p>
<p>If your business is considering going public, raising money privately, or if you&rsquo;re new to securities legislation and how it applies to Alberta businesses, these videos are for you.&nbsp;</p>
<p>These videos can&rsquo;t replace the need to read securities legislation and/or seek appropriate legal advice; however, we are hopeful they will be helpful in providing introductory information.</p>
<p>We will be developing additional videos that we anticipate launching over the next year. Please contact <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#65290c040b004b220c13000b250416064b0604"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="d79bbeb6b9b2f990bea1b2b997b6a4b4f9b4b6">[email&#160;protected]</span></a> if you have suggestions for particular content.&nbsp;</p>
<p>Click a title to watch a specific video, or scroll down to view all the videos available.&nbsp;</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Continuous Disclosure 101 Series</strong>
    <ul>
        <li><a href="https://www.asc.ca/en/issuer-regulation/issuer-and-insider-toolkit#Disclosure">ASC&rsquo;s Continuous Disclosure Review Program</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.asc.ca/en/issuer-regulation/issuer-and-insider-toolkit#Material">Material Change Reporting</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.asc.ca/en/issuer-regulation/issuer-and-insider-toolkit#BAR">Business Acquisition Report (BAR)</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.asc.ca/en/issuer-regulation/issuer-and-insider-toolkit#Certification">Certification of Disclosure</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.asc.ca/en/issuer-regulation/issuer-and-insider-toolkit#Audit">Audit Committees&nbsp;</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.asc.ca/en/issuer-regulation/issuer-and-insider-toolkit#Corporate">Corporate Governance Disclosure</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.asc.ca/en/issuer-regulation/issuer-and-insider-toolkit#CTO">Failure-To-File Cease Trade Orders &amp; Revocations&nbsp;</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.asc.ca/en/issuer-regulation/issuer-and-insider-toolkit#FLI">Forward-looking Information (FLI)</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.asc.ca/en/issuer-regulation/issuer-and-insider-toolkit#VI">Executive Compensation Disclosure &ndash; Venture Issuers&nbsp;</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.asc.ca/en/issuer-regulation/issuer-and-insider-toolkit#Changes">Corporate Changes</a></li>
    </ul>
    </li>
    <li><strong>Insider Reporting</strong>
    <ul>
        <li><a href=" https://www.asc.ca/en/issuer-regulation/issuer-and-insider-toolkit#Basics">The Basics</a></li>
