            <p>In addition, the ASC&rsquo;s Corporate Finance division conducts comprehensive and issue-oriented reviews, the results of which are summarized and shared with reporting issuers in our annual&nbsp;<a href="/-/media/ASC-Documents-part-1/Publications/2024/Reports/2024-Corporate-Finance-Disclosure-Report.pdf"><strong>Corporate Finance Disclosure Report</strong>&nbsp;</a>and&nbsp;<a href="/-/media/ASC-Documents-part-1/Publications/2024/Reports/2024-Energy-Matters-Report.pdf"><strong>Energy Matters Report</strong></a>. These documents may provide additional useful guidance for issuers.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
